Abstraction 
Abstraction is a process of hiding the implementation details and showing only the functionalities to the user with the help of abstract class or interface is called abstraction in java.
It helps in reducing complexity and improving code clarity

To Achive Abstraction we have two options
  1 Abstract Class
  2 Interface

